        <mxCell id="iam_card" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF5F6;strokeColor=#DD344C;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=70;" value="&lt;b&gt;IAM + EKS Pod Identity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #5A6C7D;&quot;&gt;the Pod Identity agent on each node trades a pod&amp;#8217;s ServiceAccount for its role &amp;#8212; no OIDC trust per role.&lt;br&gt;6 roles &amp;#183; one static key: Harbor&amp;#8217;s S3 key (its S3 driver cannot use pod roles)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="380" x="1320" y="290" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
