      <mxCell id="karpenter_note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#ED7100;&quot;&gt;+ Karpenter 1.14&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #5A6C7D;&quot;&gt;NodePools &lt;b&gt;general&lt;/b&gt; (on-demand, &amp;#8804;16 vCPU) &amp;#183; &lt;b&gt;spot-batch&lt;/b&gt; (Spot, &amp;#8804;32 vCPU) &amp;#8212; a node appears for a pending pod and is gone when idle&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
