        <mxCell id="c_af" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=64;strokeColor=#ED7100;strokeWidth=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;Airflow 3.2.2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #5A6C7D;&quot;&gt;KubernetesExecutor &amp;#183; DAGs by git-sync&lt;br&gt;creates a SparkApplication object &amp;#8212; &lt;b&gt;never a pod&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;task logs &amp;#8594; S3 (pods are gone after a task)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
